  - The original PairOut source and the CellOut source (a symlink to the same file) match each other and both prepared copies in columns, order, dtypes, index and values.
  - Split counts are 151508/18939/18938, with 85/82/83 classes present.
  - Pair indices are identical across arms, all 1666 drugs have graphs and NAI rows, and event names match exactly.
- **Static checks:** syntax checks pass on every Python and shell file, and the modules import with both configs passing the data gate. No `__pycache__` was written.
